Recommends: polkitd
Suggests: als162-sync-gui
Description: ALS162 radio time signal decoder (terminal interface)
 Decodes the ALS162 low-frequency radio time signal from an audio
 input and uses it to synchronize the system clock. This package
 contains the terminal decoder (als162_decoder) and the shared
 library code, with no graphical dependencies, suitable for
 headless or remote (SSH) systems.

Package: als162-sync-gui
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
         als162-sync (= ${source:Version}),
         python3-pyqt5,
         python3-serial
Recommends: python3-pyqt5.qtwebengine
Description: ALS162 radio and GPS clock synchronization (Qt GUI)
 Graphical front-ends for ALS162 Sync: als162_gui (radio decoder)
 and als162_gps_sync (radio decoder plus serial NMEA GPS receiver
 with offline/online maps), and the als162_download_tiles helper
 for fetching map tiles.
